{"version":1,"content":"<p>2022年入侵Rockstar並公開《GTA6》開發影像的Arion Kurtaj已獲有條件釋放。法院同時對其施加為期五年的嚴重犯罪預防令，其網絡活動將受到限制，包括禁止使用Telegram和Discord。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587796.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:03:54.533438+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:47:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.332982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.332982+00:00","content_hash":"690a67dd0ef61d9012b8ed7513e55461c19e15960ff258e34020d4e67085f1ac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}